{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 阳台园艺 (balcony gardening) - focused on home plant care, planting methods, growth principles. Explicitly NOT interested in flower shop operations or courtyard engineering quotes.\n- No explicit preferences or recent recommendations.\n\nLet me examine the candidates. The working set has 80 candidates. I need to select 20 that are relevant to the garden interest while avoiding content that falls outside the interest scope (flower shop operations, courtyard engineering quotes, market observations about pricing).\n\nLet me look at the candidate descriptions. Many candidates have descriptions that are \"市场观察\" (market observation) which discusses flower shop pricing, commercial landscape engineering quotes, etc. These fall outside the interest scope (\"不关注花店经营或庭院工程报价\").\n\nLet me identify the content types:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - relevant\n- 操作记录 (operation record) - relevant\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - relevant\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about plant naming history, garden aesthetics, city exhibitions - this is somewhat tangential but still garden-related\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - about flower shop pricing, commercial landscape quotes - NOT relevant to the interest\n\nThe interest explicitly says: \"不关注花店经营或庭院工程报价\" (does not care about flower shop operations or courtyard engineering quotes). So market observation articles should be excluded.\n\nLet me select 20 candidates that are relevant. I need to pick from the candidates provided. Let me identify the relevant ones (excluding market observations).\n\nLet me scan through the candidates and categorize. The candidates list is large. Let me identify which are market observations (to exclude) and which are relevant.\n\nMarket observation candidates (exclude):\n- item-18b36293621a 月季光照：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-1de472d5c51f 盆栽越冬：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-2008d7b27ed9 盆栽越冬：通风露台中的市场观察\n- item-327ab77da510 盆土透气：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-363059bb3cc7 番茄育苗：通风露台中的市场观察\n- item-4425b4436dc2 薄荷修剪：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-53294f157aec 多肉浇水：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-53f94c4f082a 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-545936ea40c6 草莓授粉：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-584d4349511e 月季光照：夏季室内中的市场观察\n- item-5e7665c76538 薄荷修剪：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n\nThe interest is about balcony gardening with home plant care. The 专题观察 (special topic observation) articles are about plant naming history, garden aesthetics, city exhibitions, paintings, literary imagery, local culture. These are somewhat tangential to the core interest of plant care/planting methods. But they're still garden-related. However, given the interest focuses on \"家庭植物养护、种植方法和生长原理\" (home plant care, planting methods, growth principles), the 专题观察 content about naming history and aesthetics is less aligned. \n\nActually, let me reconsider. The interest description is about balcony gardening focusing on home plant care, planting methods, growth principles. The most relevant content types are:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - practical care\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - growth principles\n- 概念速览 (concept overviews) - concepts\n\nThe 专题观察 (special topic) about naming history, aesthetics, exhibitions is less aligned with the core interest but still garden-related. The 市场观察 is explicitly excluded.\n\nI need to select 20 candidates. Let me focus on the most relevant ones - the operation records, conditions/principles, and concept overviews that relate to plant care.\n\nLet me select a balanced set across different plants and locations. Let me pick candidates that are clearly relevant to home plant care.\n\nLet me choose 20 from the relevant candidates. I'll aim for a good mix of plant types (草莓, 蓝莓, 薄荷, 香草, 番茄, 月季, 多肉, 盆栽, 盆土, 黄叶) and content types (操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览).\n\nLet me select candidates. I'll pick from the operation records and conditions/principles primarily, plus some concept overviews.\n\nLet me list relevant candidates (excluding market observations and possibly special topic observations):\n\nOperation records (操作记录):\n- item-002280b87be1 草莓授粉：半阴窗台\n- item-0203081e5c85 薄荷修剪：通风露台\n- item-02270edcb008 香草扦插：通风露台\n- item-02afa433233c 蓝莓基质：朝南阳台\n- item-055c41141fa3 盆土透气：通风露台\n- item-096aa2f3c184 多肉浇水：夏季室内\n- item-13c3e3ea6eff 月季光照：半阴窗台\n- item-160347be1b39 香草扦插：朝南阳台\n- item-1686447be4ae 番茄育苗：通风露台\n- item-26e02f642b93 盆栽越冬：朝南阳台\n- item-28a8d8a64d46 多肉浇水：朝南阳台\n- item-309258e8bc8e 番茄育苗：朝南阳台\n- item-3388cf0e679b 盆土透气：夏季室内\n- item-33e034f08c2b 黄叶排查：通风露台\n- item-37c032bcc847 黄叶排查：夏季室内\n- item-426fe311e003 盆栽越冬：通风露台\n- item-4b9d0781f27e 薄荷修剪：夏季室内\n- item-52be0a87a495 香草扦插：半阴窗台\n- item-5da6b295e272 草莓授粉：朝南阳台\n\nConditions and principles (条件与原理):\n- item-04bde6ad0003 盆土透气：夏季室内\n- item-0ee7c59bda70 多肉浇水：半阴窗台\n- item-12ade2b2e5e1 月季光照：通风露台\n- item-1413b31a8254 多肉浇水：夏季室内\n- item-173080c8a696 黄叶排查：半阴窗台\n- item-1cb3d12a82fc 盆栽越冬：通风露台\n- item-22359398a920 薄荷修剪：夏季室内\n- item-3faf9f095870 盆土透气：通风露台\n- item-418ab8f70803 月季光照：夏季室内\n- item-44d2953a9dd1 薄荷修剪：朝南阳台\n- item-45fb6da94e7d 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台\n- item-463f0047433f 薄荷修剪：半阴窗台\n- item-4e425694d9db 草莓授粉：通风露台\n- item-52c619201ab3 黄叶排查：通风露台\n- item-53be14d6d282 番茄育苗：通风露台\n\nConcept overviews (概念速览):\n- item-00c0cea6b0c6 盆土透气：夏季室内\n- item-013fccf40557 香草扦插：朝南阳台\n- item-015275c63e27 蓝莓基质：通风露台\n- item-025b955e2312 盆栽越冬：通风露台\n- item-04c217827669 番茄育苗：朝南阳台\n- item-0b2671963ef3 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台\n- item-0ee4229d4c27 香草扦插：夏季室内\n- item-103a7d29702e 番茄育苗：夏季室内\n- item-1325bfab77b8 草莓授粉：夏季室内\n- item-14963e253087 ... (this is 专题观察 actually)\n- item-15afc24e68b9 多肉浇水：半阴窗台\n- item-1b0dc8fac7fb 盆土透气：通风露台\n- item-2475328e0c7e 薄荷修剪：夏季室内\n- item-3739247177a3 盆土透气：朝南阳台\n- item-385e78f94655 月季光照：通风露台\n- item-46b955653891 多肉浇水：夏季室内\n- item-498d6c2607fe 多肉浇水：朝南阳台\n- item-4d3afa1197e6 黄叶排查：朝南阳台\n- item-4e192281f76f 多肉浇水：通风露台\n- item-511c8eaa9f50 薄荷修剪：通风露台\n- item-582611ba84e7 盆栽越冬：半阴窗台\n- item-5f92c5ec4764 番茄育苗：半阴窗台\n\nI have plenty of candidates. I need to select 20. Given the interest is about home plant care, planting methods, and growth principles, I'll prioritize operation records and conditions/principles articles, which are most directly aligned with practical care and growth principles.\n\nLet me select a balanced set of 20. I'll aim for diversity across plant types and locations.\n\nLet me select these 20:\n1. item-002280b87be1 草莓授粉：半阴窗台操作记录\n2. item-0203081e5c85 薄荷修剪：通风露台操作记录\n3. item-02afa433233c 蓝莓基质：朝南阳台操作记录\n4. item-096aa2f3c184 多肉浇水：夏季室内操作记录\n5. item-160347be1b39 香草扦插：朝南阳台操作记录\n6. item-1686447be4ae 番茄育苗：通风露台操作记录\n7. item-26e02f642b93 盆栽越冬：朝南阳台操作记录\n8. item-309258e8bc8e 番茄育苗：朝南阳台操作记录\n9. item-3388cf0e679b 盆土透气：夏季室内操作记录\n10. item-37c032bcc847 黄叶排查：夏季室内操作记录\n11. item-04bde6ad0003 盆土透气：夏季室内条件与原理\n12. item-0ee7c59bda70 多肉浇水：半阴窗台条件与原理\n13. item-12ade2b2e5e1 月季光照：通风露台条件与原理\n14. item-1413b31a8254 多肉浇水：夏季室内条件与原理\n15. item-173080c8a696 黄叶排查：半阴窗台条件与原理\n16. item-1cb3d12a82fc 盆栽越冬：通风露台条件与原理\n17. item-418ab8f70803 月季光照：夏季室内条件与原理\n18. item-44d2953a9dd1 薄荷修剪：朝南阳台条件与原理\n19. item-45fb6da94e7d 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台条件与原理\n20. item-53be14d6d282 番茄育苗：通风露台条件与原理\n\nWait, let me reconsider. I should verify the candidates are all relevant and provide good reasons. Let me check the candidate facts are sufficient. The descriptions are quite generic (template-like). All candidates matched the garden interest directly.\n\nGiven the interest is about balcony gardening (阳台园艺), home plant care, planting methods, growth principles. All these candidates are about plant care topics in balcony/window/terrace settings. They're all relevant.\n\nI should avoid the market observation ones (explicitly out of scope). I've done that.\n\nLet me reconsider whether to include some concept overviews for variety. The task says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" Since there's only one interest and one source (open_web), balance across content types matters somewhat. But the core interest is practical care. I'll include a mix but lean toward the most relevant.\n\nActually, let me reconsider including a good balance. Let me include a mix of operation records, conditions/principles, and concept overviews. Let me pick 20 with good diversity.\n\nLet me finalize my selection with a good balance. I'll include operation records, conditions/principles, and a few concept overviews.\n\nLet me reconsider - I want to make sure I'm not over-selecting from one plant type. Let me build a diverse set.\n\nFinal selection (20):\n1. item-002280b87be1 草莓授粉：半阴窗台操作记录\n2. item-0203081e5c85 薄荷修剪：通风露台操作记录\n3. item-02afa433233c 蓝莓基质：朝南阳台操作记录\n4. item-096aa2f3c184 多肉浇水：夏季室内操作记录\n5. item-160347be1b39 香草扦插：朝南阳台操作记录\n6. item-1686447be4ae 番茄育苗：通风露台操作记录\n7. item-26e02f642b93 盆栽越冬：朝南阳台操作记录\n8. item-3388cf0e679b 盆土透气：夏季室内操作记录\n9. item-37c032bcc847 黄叶排查：夏季室内操作记录\n10. item-04bde6ad0003 盆土透气：夏季室内条件与原理\n11. item-0ee7c59bda70 多肉浇水：半阴窗台条件与原理\n12. item-12ade2b2e5e1 月季光照：通风露台条件与原理\n13. item-1413b31a8254 多肉浇水：夏季室内条件与原理\n14. item-173080c8a696 黄叶排查：半阴窗台条件与原理\n15. item-1cb3d12a82fc 盆栽越冬：通风露台条件与原理\n16. item-418ab8f70803 月季光照：夏季室内条件与原理\n17. item-44d2953a9dd1 薄荷修剪：朝南阳台条件与原理\n18. item-45fb6da94e7d 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台条件与原理\n19. item-53be14d6d282 番茄育苗：通风露台条件与原理\n20. item-013fccf40557 香草扦插：朝南阳台概念速览\n\nHmm, let me reconsider. I have 10 operation records, 9 conditions/principles, 1 concept overview. That's reasonable balance leaning toward practical content.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether I should include more concept overviews for balance. But given the interest emphasizes practical care and growth principles, operation records and conditions/principles are most relevant. I'll keep a mix.\n\nLet me verify these candidates exist in the list. All the IDs I selected appear in the candidates list. Good.\n\nLet me provide grounded recommendation reasons for each. Since the descriptions are template-like, I'll base reasons on the topic (plant type + care activity + location) and how it relates to the user's balcony gardening interest.\n\nLet me publish.","type":"text"},